  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "When an event has been fired, it should be possible to query the state of the event including:\n- The source of the event (Local via SendCustomEvent or built-in events like Interact, Collision, etc, or Remote for network calls via SendCustomNetworkEvent)\n- The object that fired the event (or null if not relevant to the event)\n- The player that fired the event (LocalPlayer or null if the event source is local)\n- The name of the event (should return the internal name of the event for built-in events (e.g. Interact would return \"_interact\", or the name of the custom event)\n- Additional parameters that were passed to the event (may provide a more flexible alternative to retrieving custom event parameters)",
